diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..06d5a99 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,43 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## Push subscriptions
+
+Everything that lands in someone's tray can also reach their phone and desktop. A device
+subscribes by handing over the subscription it got from the push service.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Subscribes a device to push notifications for the current user.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The URL the push service handed out for this device |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The base64url-encoded P-256 public key of the device |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The base64url-encoded authentication secret of the device |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/abc123",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNcR1...",
+    "auth_key": "k7yQ..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:endpoint`
+
+Unsubscribes a device from push notifications. The endpoint is the base64url-encoded URL the
+push service handed out for the device.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
